  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Nexus Initiative (Global)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Nexus Initiative (Nexus) supports sexual and reproductive health outcomes by providing tailored tools, strategic policy analysis, and technical support to a cross-regional intergovernmental group of SRHR champions, with a focus on related UN mechanisms. Phase 1 was 2018-2021. Renewed for a second phase 2022-24. Renewed for a third phase 2025- 2029.</narrative>
  </description>
